    {
      "id": "ff695fa287b336c415f1cb221a79d1e0ed6da69b",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 476686872,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Hmmm, wait a second, is not that a feature, not a bug? I mean, yeah, sure it can be confusing, but in case of only some packets selected, it will not parse all of packets... Dunno?\n\nAlso, from that issue \n\n>while the display filter limits yourself to (say) SIP messages.\n\nis not true (anymore(?)), it now selects both SIP (\"frame.number in\") and RTP messages (\"rtp.setup-frame in\") when you press prepare filter in VoIP calls.",
          "author": {
            "id": 4334216,
            "username": "ValZapod",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Valerii Zapod.",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8cbd6d8ace62b0f9ddde773e6b7b781f0179e7b0a397aad45f4386db6d4dffbc?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/ValZapod"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-01-01T20:46:21.517Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-01-01T20:47:01.515Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 83399792,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
