    },
    {
      "id": "a4c0883a9af609b949bf5b319984ec751b272979",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 476691566,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I'm not sure whether we are discussing same topic...\n\nRTP Player dialog shows/plays one or more RTP streams. It shows RTP stream identification in table and wareform in graph above.\nYou can't open RTP Player directly. RTP Player is opened from other dialogs and every time it receives list of RTP Stream to show. So it depends on other dialogs what RTP Player should process.\n\nThe issue #13325 says you can select RTP stream in other dialog, RTP Player shows it in table, but do not see/play its waveform. It happens e.g. when:\n1) you enter 'sip' as display filter\n2) open VoIP Calls dialog (you see it, it matches sip display filter)\n3) select one of SIP calls and press 'Play Streams'\n4) you see RTP stream in the player (it was decoded from SIP signaling), but some items are empty and you see no waveform (RTP packets do not match sip display filter)\n\nI think that this behaving (step 4) is wrong and makes no sense. It is probably residue from past when RTP player was acting as direct view of streams (ethereal times).\n\nI just removed check for display filter from RTP Player therefore in step 4) you see complete RTP stream statistics and waveform independently the dialog was opened.\n\nBTW I implemented option to enable/disable use of display filter during processing of VoIP Calls dialog and RTP Streams dialog in !1549. Both dialogs were showing all calls/streams even display filter was active. Now you can control it.\n\nI hope my change in RTP Stream dialog makes sense.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7791033,
            "username": "j.novak",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "j.novak@netsystem.cz",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b98b9c10d87ea9f383019b704e727c94ba6895dd3c46291d23e400738e1c6f1d?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/j.novak"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-01-01T21:46:21.767Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-01-01T21:46:21.767Z",
